OL,3,ASam Fender pre-sale moved after 'bot
OL,4,Aattack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGigantic said its system had detected
OL,7,Fan "unusually high volume of suspicious
OL,8,Factivity" resulting in error messages
OL,9,Fon its site and it had halted the
OL,10,Fpre-sale to protect fans.
